<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>5-Paragraph Essay Builder</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 50%, #7e22ce 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #e8edf5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3), rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.3));
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 1em;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 40px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .prompt-section {
            background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .prompt-section h2 {
            color: #e8edf5;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .prompt-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1em;
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 80px;
            font-family: inherit;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            color: #e8edf5;
        }

        .prompt-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .paragraph-section {
            background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .paragraph-section:hover {
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.7);
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .intro .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
        }

        .body1 .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #1d4ed8);
        }

        .body2 .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9);
        }

        .body3 .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706);
        }

        .conclusion .section-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626);
        }

        .word-count {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .subsection {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .subsection-label {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .content-textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            min-height: 80px;
            font-size: 1em;
            resize: vertical;
            font-family: inherit;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            color: #e8edf5;
        }

        .content-textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .transition-dropdown {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .transition-dropdown select {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 250px;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            color: #e8edf5;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .transition-dropdown select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .tips {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border-radius: 6px;
            border-left: 3px solid #3b82f6;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .feedback {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .feedback p {
            margin: 6px 0;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
        }

        .feedback p.warn {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            border-left-color: #f59e0b;
        }

        .feedback p.error {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
            border-left-color: #ef4444;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.4);
            border-radius: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.8);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .preview-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            z-index: 1000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .preview-content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.98);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 80%;
            max-height: 80%;
            overflow-y: auto;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .preview-content h2 {
            color: #e8edf5;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .preview-text {
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.05em;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .preview-text p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-indent: 2em;
        }

        textarea::placeholder,
        select option:first-child {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.7);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>📝 5-Paragraph Essay Builder</h1>
            <p>Craft a well-structured essay with introduction, body paragraphs, and conclusion</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="prompt-section">
                <h2>📋 Essay Prompt/Topic</h2>
                <textarea 
                    class="prompt-input" 
                    id="promptInput"
                    placeholder="Paste your essay prompt or topic here..."
                ></textarea>
            </div>

            <!-- INTRODUCTION PARAGRAPH -->
            <div class="paragraph-section intro">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-title">Paragraph 1: Introduction</div>
                    <div class="word-count" id="introWordCount">0 words</div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Hook Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="hook"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Start with an attention-grabbing hook (question, quote, interesting fact, or scenario)..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="hookFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Background/Context (2-3 sentences)</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="background"
                        placeholder="Provide background information and context about your topic..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Thesis Statement</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="thesis"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Write your clear thesis statement that previews your three main points..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="thesisFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="tips">
                    💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Your introduction should funnel from general to specific, ending with a strong thesis that outlines your three main arguments.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BODY PARAGRAPH 1 -->
            <div class="paragraph-section body1">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-title">Paragraph 2: Body Paragraph 1</div>
                    <div class="word-count" id="body1WordCount">0 words</div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="transition-dropdown">
                        <select id="transition1">
                            <option value="">Choose transition...</option>
                            <option value="First,">First,</option>
                            <option value="To begin with,">To begin with,</option>
                            <option value="Initially,">Initially,</option>
                            <option value="One reason is that">One reason is that</option>
                            <option value="The first point to consider is">The first point to consider is</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="subsection-label">Topic Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body1Topic"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="State your first main point that supports your thesis..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="body1TopicFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Evidence & Explanation</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body1Evidence"
                        placeholder="Provide specific evidence (examples, facts, quotes) and explain how it supports your topic sentence..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Concluding Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body1Concluding"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Wrap up this point and transition to the next paragraph..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="tips">
                    💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Follow the structure: Topic Sentence → Evidence → Explanation → Concluding Sentence.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BODY PARAGRAPH 2 -->
            <div class="paragraph-section body2">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-title">Paragraph 3: Body Paragraph 2</div>
                    <div class="word-count" id="body2WordCount">0 words</div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="transition-dropdown">
                        <select id="transition2">
                            <option value="">Choose transition...</option>
                            <option value="Second,">Second,</option>
                            <option value="Additionally,">Additionally,</option>
                            <option value="Furthermore,">Furthermore,</option>
                            <option value="Another reason is that">Another reason is that</option>
                            <option value="In addition,">In addition,</option>
                            <option value="Moreover,">Moreover,</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="subsection-label">Topic Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body2Topic"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="State your second main point that supports your thesis..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="body2TopicFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Evidence & Explanation</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body2Evidence"
                        placeholder="Provide specific evidence (examples, facts, quotes) and explain how it supports your topic sentence..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Concluding Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body2Concluding"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Wrap up this point and transition to the next paragraph..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="tips">
                    💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Make sure this point is distinct from your first body paragraph but still supports your thesis.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BODY PARAGRAPH 3 -->
            <div class="paragraph-section body3">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-title">Paragraph 4: Body Paragraph 3</div>
                    <div class="word-count" id="body3WordCount">0 words</div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="transition-dropdown">
                        <select id="transition3">
                            <option value="">Choose transition...</option>
                            <option value="Third,">Third,</option>
                            <option value="Finally,">Finally,</option>
                            <option value="Lastly,">Lastly,</option>
                            <option value="Most importantly,">Most importantly,</option>
                            <option value="The final reason is that">The final reason is that</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="subsection-label">Topic Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body3Topic"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="State your third main point that supports your thesis..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="body3TopicFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Evidence & Explanation</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body3Evidence"
                        placeholder="Provide specific evidence (examples, facts, quotes) and explain how it supports your topic sentence..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Concluding Sentence</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="body3Concluding"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Wrap up this point and transition to the conclusion..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="tips">
                    💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> This is often your strongest argument. Make it count!
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CONCLUSION PARAGRAPH -->
            <div class="paragraph-section conclusion">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-title">Paragraph 5: Conclusion</div>
                    <div class="word-count" id="conclusionWordCount">0 words</div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="transition-dropdown">
                        <select id="transitionConclusion">
                            <option value="">Choose transition...</option>
                            <option value="In conclusion,">In conclusion,</option>
                            <option value="To summarize,">To summarize,</option>
                            <option value="In summary,">In summary,</option>
                            <option value="Therefore,">Therefore,</option>
                            <option value="Ultimately,">Ultimately,</option>
                            <option value="As demonstrated,">As demonstrated,</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="subsection-label">Restated Thesis</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="restatedThesis"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="Restate your thesis in different words..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="feedback" id="conclusionFeedback"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Summary of Main Points</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="summary"
                        placeholder="Briefly summarize your three main points..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="subsection">
                    <div class="subsection-label">Closing Thought</div>
                    <textarea 
                        class="content-textarea" 
                        id="closingThought"
                        style="min-height: 60px;"
                        placeholder="End with a final thought, call to action, or broader implication..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="tips">
                    💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Your conclusion should leave a lasting impression. Don't just repeat—synthesize and reflect on the significance of your argument.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="actions">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary">🗑️ Clear All</button>
                <button class="btn btn-primary">👁️ Preview Essay</button>
                <button class="btn btn-success">📋 Copy to Clipboard</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="preview-modal" id="previewModal">
        <div class="preview-content">
            <h2>📄 Your Complete Essay</h2>
            <div class="preview-text" id="previewText"></div>
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hidden aria-live region for status announcements -->
    <div id="status-announcements" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"></div>

    <!-- External JavaScript -->
    <script src="presentation-08.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

